  "en": {
    "description": "BridgeBox is a local bridge between Jackbox Party Pack and your ISP. It opens an entry point for the game on your own machine and routes its traffic around DPI blocking, so rooms create and hold steady even on networks that can't reach Jackbox's servers directly.",
